      "text": "Bacca gialla dal sapore acido usata per creare\nPokémelle che aumentano la Grinta del Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Used to make Pokéblocks that will enhance your\nToughness. Its yellow flesh is sour when eaten.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "たくましさに　磨きを　かける　ための\nポロックを　つくるとき　使われる。\n黄色の実は　食べると　酸っぱい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用于制作宝可方块，\n制作出来的宝可方块可用来打磨强壮。\n黄色的果实尝起来是酸的。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Se utiliza en la producción de Pokécubos que potencian\nla dureza. Es de color amarillo y sabor ácido.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
